  "description": "Captus brings premium e-bike technology to a price point that makes sense. Powered by a Bosch e-system with a 400Wh battery and Active Line motor, it’s built for reliable performance on city streets and beyond. Smooth power, proven components, and a design that’s ready for everyday use. The mid-step frame offers a sleek, versatile look with confident handling - perfect for commuting, errands, or weekend rides. You get the right kit from the start: Shimano 9-speed gears, hydraulic disc brakes, integrated front and rear lights, full mudguards, and a pannier rack for carrying what matters (up to 27kg of it)! With 700C wheels for efficient rolling and a build that prioritises reliability, Captus is ready to make every ride easier. Just get on, start pedalling, and let it do the hard work. Premium performance without the premium price tag. No gimmicks - just a well-made e-bike designed to keep up with your life. Range Calculator Use this calculator to better estimate the range you might achieve based on your riding conditions: Bosch Ebike Calculator (Please check the specification to ensure your select the correct motor and battery. The total travel distance will depend on the capacity of the battery, rider and luggage weight, power mode setting and riding style.) Important Please be aware that this bike is regulated in line with existing Electric Power Assisted Cycles regulations. Any modification to the bike will invalidate the guarantee and in particular any modification which increases the power of the motor and/or the top assisted speed of the bike may make the rider liable to prosecution. Excluding statutory obligations Raleigh will not be held responsible for any injuries incurred following any modification to this product.",
